# Contributing (TEMPLATE — not active until copied to /CONTRIBUTING.md)

> PSR-8c0 draft. Do not treat this path as the canonical contribution guide.

## Before you start

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture/platform-simplification-remediation.mdoc`
2. Prefer fast-track verification; no full gates without Architect YES
3. Doc-first for protected packages (`apps/api`, `platform-core`, `workspace-sdk`)

## Development

```bash
nvm use && corepack enable
pnpm install
pnpm run pre-commit:fast
```

## Pull requests

- Small, focused diffs
- Include proof (smoke / targeted test) in the PR body
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or absolute machine paths

